{"toolCallId":"call_d2f4c4967e374f7b9f6f985e7b160194","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"Output from command in shell fc4291:\n\nSpec Folder Validation v3.0.0\n\n  Folder: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8a66e200e3/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent\n  Level:  1\n  Engine: orchestrator\n\n+ FILE_EXISTS: All required files present for Level 1\n! PLACEHOLDER_FILLED: 36 unfilled value token(s) in a Draft packet. Fill each one before the status leaves Draft\n    - spec.md:3: description: \"[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What is broken, missing, or inefficient? 2-3 sentences describing the specific pain poin\n    - spec.md:23: | **Priority** | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: P0/P1/P2] |\n    - spec.md:36: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What is broken, missing, or inefficient? 2-3 sentences describing the specific pain point.]\n    - spec.md:39: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: One-sentence outcome statement. What does success look like?]\n    - spec.md:49: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Deliverable 1]\n    - spec.md:50: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Deliverable 2]\n    - spec.md:51: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Deliverable 3]\n    - spec.md:54: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Excluded item 1] - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: why]\n    - spec.md:55: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Excluded item 2] - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: why]\n    - spec.md:61: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: path/to/file.js] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Modify/Create/Delete] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Brief description] |\n    - spec.md:74: | REQ-001 | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Requirement description] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How to verify it's done] |\n    - spec.md:80: | REQ-002 | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Requirement description] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How to verify it's done] |\n    - spec.md:89: - **SC-001**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Primary measurable outcome]\n    - spec.md:90: - **SC-002**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Secondary measurable outcome]\n    - spec.md:101: | Dependency | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: System/API] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What if blocked] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Fallback plan] |\n    - spec.md:102: | Risk | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Risk description] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: High/Med/Low] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Mitigation strategy] \n    - spec.md:111: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Question 1 requiring clarification]\n    - spec.md:112: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Question 2 requiring clarification]\n    - plan.md:24: | **Language/Stack** | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: e.g., TypeScript, Python 3.11] |\n    - plan.md:25: | **Framework** | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: e.g., React, FastAPI] |\n    - plan.md:26: | **Storage** | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: e.g., PostgreSQL, None] |\n    - plan.md:27: | **Testing** | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: e.g., Jest, pytest] |\n    - plan.md:57: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: MVC | MVVM | Clean Architecture | Serverless | Monolith | Other]\n    - plan.md:60: - **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Component 1]**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Purpose]\n    - plan.md:61: - **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Component 2]**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Purpose]\n    - plan.md:64: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Brief description of how data moves through the system]\n    - tasks.md:47: - [ ] T004 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 1]\n    - tasks.md:48: - [ ] T005 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 2]\n    - tasks.md:49: - [ ] T006 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 3]\n    - tasks.md:50: - [ ] T007 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Add error handling]\n    - implementation-summary.md:50: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Opening hook: 2-3 sentences on what changed and why it matters. Lead with impact.]\n    - implementation-summary.md:61: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: path] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Created/Modified/Deleted] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What this change accomplishe\n    - implementation-summary.md:70: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How was this tested, verified and shipped? What was the rollout approach?]\n    - implementation-summary.md:81: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What was decided] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Active-voice rationale with specific reasoning] |\n    - implementation-summary.md:92: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Validation, lint, tests, manual check] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: PASS/FAIL with specifics] |\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8a66e200e3/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"725c90","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
